# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXORA AI — optional LLM provider configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The chatbot works out of the box against the free, no-key endpoint
# (text.pollinations.ai). To point it at any OpenAI-compatible API
# (OpenAI, Groq, local vLLM/ollama proxy, etc.), copy this file to
# .env.local and fill in the values, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
#   VITE_CHAT_API_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
#   VITE_CHAT_API_KEY=sk-your-secret-key
#   VITE_CHAT_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# You can also override these at RUNTIME from the browser console
# (no rebuild needed):
#   localStorage.setItem('nexora_chat_url',  'https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions');
#   localStorage.setItem('nexora_chat_key',  'sk-your-secret-key');
#   localStorage.setItem('nexora_chat_model','gpt-4o-mini');
#   location.reload();
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXORA SOS backend bridge (optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The one-tap "SOS Signal" button posts citizen beacons to a tiny
# Node backend (server/sos-server.mjs, run with `npm run server`) that
# stores them and streams them live to the authorities dashboard.
#
# In development the Vite dev server proxies /api/* to
# http://localhost:3001 automatically, so you normally leave this empty.
# Set it only when the app is hosted separately from the backend:
#
#   VITE_API_URL=https://sos.example.com
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The chatbot's free AI is relayed through this backend (POST /api/chat),
# which forwards server-side to text.pollinations.ai with no browser
# Origin header (that is what keeps it out of the provider's CAPTCHA).
# To point the relay at a different OpenAI-compatible URL, set:
#
#   LLM_RELAY_URL=https://your-openai-compatible-endpoint
# ------------------------------------------------------------------